<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-LUYENDYK WINS INDIANAPOLIS 500.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-LUYENDYK WINS INDIANAPOLIS 500.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Indiana 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arie Luyendyk won the Indianapolis 500 on Tuesday, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Scott Goodyear finished second and rookie Jeff Ward was third ahead of last year's winner, Buddy Lazier.</p>
</text>
